WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.219 --> 00:00:12.260
One in five marriages in the world are between
first cousins.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.750
The founders of Hewlett-Packard flipped a
coin to decide which of them would come first

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.869
in the company name.

00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:25.239
The facial expressions on Lego figures have
become increasingly angry over the last 30

00:00:25.239 --> 00:00:26.239
years.

00:00:26.239 --> 00:00:30.619
A quarter of philosophers believe in zombies.

00:00:30.619 --> 00:00:37.140
Alligators balance twigs on their noses, to
lure birds looking for nest-building materials.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:43.830
1 in 3 children today can use a tablet before
they can speak.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:50.250
Wine can be artificially 'aged' by passing
it through an electric field for three minutes.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:55.490
John Lennon and George Harrison once got a
bus across Liverpool to visit a man who could

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:58.030
teach them the chord B7.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:04.549
Toshers was a name for men who earned a living
by searching London's sewers for lost valuables.

00:01:04.549 --> 00:01:11.140
An elephant call can be heard anywhere within
100 square miles.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:16.200
By 2050, 70% of people will live in cities.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:22.880
The pinstripe on a Rolls Royce is hand painted,
with no margin for error as the paint has

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:27.820
special properties which makes it instantly
bond to the underlying car paint.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:36.150
The job is reserved for one man only, Mark
Court, his sole job is to paint that pinstripe

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.350
on every new Rolls Royce.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:49.250
1 out of 10 passwords used on the Internet
are either 'Password', '123456' or '12345678'.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:55.290
A newborn baby sucks in air with 50 times
the power of an adult.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:02:01.689
People eating in a group of seven or more
eat twice as much as people eating alone.

00:02:01.689 --> 00:02:10.119
It takes 700 grapes to make one bottle of
wine.

